      "title": "Indian opposition party’s youth wing warns of more Meta protests after police clashes",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/india-congress-meta-protests-police-hyderabad",
      "description": "<p>Members of Congress party clashed with police outside tech company’s offices on Friday</p><p>The youth wing of India’s main opposition Congress party warned of more protests against Meta’s removal of some of its members’ ⁠accounts, ⁠a day after clashing with ​police outside the tech firm’s locals offices.</p><p>In Hyderabad on Friday, protesters ‌carrying placards and chanted slogans as they stormed into ‌the building that houses Meta’s offices, smashing plants to the ground and clashing with police, according to footage released by the Indian Youth Congress’s X account.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/india-congress-meta-protests-police-hyderabad\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-22T09:14:27"
    },
    {
      "title": "Protesters storm Meta offices in India",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1039732/protesters-storm-meta-offices-in-india",
      "description": "Members of the opposition Congress party protested outside Meta's offices in Delhi on Friday and appear to have entered the building in a video shared by CNN. Members of the party's youth wing are demanding the company restore accounts of party leaders and warned of more protests to come. The Congress party has criticized Meta [&#8230;]",
